{{Documentation}}
This template is used to display a [[Catnip Challenges]] Mission. It is powered by [[Module:Mission]] and relies on being used inside {{t|MissionTable}}.

==Parameters==
<pre>
==Missions==
{{MissionTable
|{{Mission|requirement|reward|image|type = }}
}}
</pre>
The first parameter is the explanation of the requirement for completing the mission. Next, the second parameter is the reward obtained when completing the mission. The third parameter specifies the image to use, accepting a string such that the file <code>Stamp reward <image>.png</code> exists or alternatively a full file name including the file extension. The <code>type</code> parameter is used to specify the mission type (main, weekly, monthly, special). The background color is different for each type, and the default is set to main. It is necessary for the template to be put in a table, and as many templates as necessary can be included in one table.

Below is a table of reward names with the corresponding image parameters for the stamp reward images. See the "Image" column of [[Module:Stamps.csv]] for a full list.
