==Example==
<pre>
==Missions==
{{MissionTable
|{{Mission|Level up one Cat the [[Upgrade Menu]]!<br>(Tap the "Power Up!" button to upgrade a Cat)|Cat Food +20|food}}
|{{Mission|Complete all Level 2 Stories of [[Stories of Legend]] to complete this mission.|Platinum Ticket +1|platinumticket}}
|{{Mission|Clear XP reward stages 5 times!<br>(Check applicable stages in Mission details: 0 of 5)|Cat Ticket +1|catticket|type = weekly}}
|{{Mission|Defeat [[Gory]] at Empire of Cats Ch. 2<br>(Once at any Empire of Cats Ch. 2 stage)|Sniper the Cat +1|sniper|type = monthly}}
|{{Mission|Clear "Lovesick Again" stages 5 times!<br>Clear any Lovesick Again stage: 0 of 5|Cat Ticket +1|catticket|type = special}}
}}
</pre>
